sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Web as Web App
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant Auth as Auth Service
    participant User as User Service
    participant Bill as Billing
    participant Queue as Job Queue
    participant Worker as Worker
    participant Data as Warehouse

    Web->>API: Submit project creation request with initial configuration and notification preferences
    API->>Auth: Validate session, workspace membership, and granular feature permissions
    Auth-->>API: Authorization context with user identity and effective permissions
    API->>User: Load organization defaults, templates, and onboarding state
    User-->>API: Organization context and user profile settings
    API->>Bill: Check plan limits, seat availability, and project-level entitlement rules
    Bill-->>API: Usage snapshot and allowed feature set
    API->>Queue: Enqueue background provisioning job with all normalized request metadata
    Queue-->>Worker: Dispatch provisioning task to worker pool
    Worker->>Data: Persist audit trail, project metadata, and setup checkpoints for reporting
    Data-->>Worker: Storage confirmed
    Worker-->>API: Project ready with identifiers, status, and follow-up tasks
    API-->>Web: Return success payload for inline confirmation and post-create navigation
